          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BCP451 Ada Blvd

Posted: N 53° 33.749 W 113° 26.184

My GPSr: N 53° 33.749 W 113° 26.185&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GeoGuider and I met up with Team WillowZilla today to do some brass caps. We brought along a bag full of tools. Tim brought along a long screw driver that BVPete left behind at a brass cap.somewhere along the way. A quick wipe and some cleaning and we could take pictures. Unfortunately, some of the numbers are not very readable. Thanks for the cap outforthehunt.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
